# T-1140: Predicate pattern with an explicit lambda expression.
# [fn [let x] [> [str-length x] 3]] evaluates to a function; called with scrutinee.
# "hello" has str-length 5 > 3, so the predicate returns true and the first arm matches.
[
  word: "hello"
  result: [match word
    [fn [let x] [> [str-length x] 3]]: "long"
    _:                                  "short"]
]
---
%.result
=== out
String("long")
